df_neg = pd.DataFrame({
    "label": ["X", "Y", "Z"],
    "change": [-0.002, -5.3, 0.7],
})

GT(df_neg, rowname_col="label").sub_small_vals(columns="change", threshold=0.01, sign="-")
```

